.SH NAME

jogtranslator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.HP
.B loadrt jogtranslator [count=\fIN\fB|names=\fIname1\fB[,\fIname2...\fB]]
.SH DESCRIPTION

This comp is intended to do the mapping of the raw ring, wheel and buttons off a ShuttlXpress
   to allow them to be connected to control jogging
   The buttons can be made to latch as a set of radio buttons
   A input can be used to cycle a set of values in powers of 10 starting from a minimum value.
.SH FUNCTIONS
.TP
\fBjogtranslator.\fIN\fB\fR (requires a floating-point thread)
This comp translates raw data from shuttle devices to drive jogging pins
